0.01 (13 Sep 2025)

- Created auto/* scripts for cleaning, configuration, and building
  Added main Makefile: $ sudo make build

- Created the package base for the KoruX distribution in config/package-lists

- Added GRUB2 configuration for BIOS (grub-pc) with custom font, theme, and
  splash.png background in config/bootloaders/grub-pc

- config/packages.chroot
    - Added 'korux-tests' package containing KoruX-specific tests
    - Added 'korux-reference' package that links to the GitHub Wiki
    - Added patched 'calamares-settings-korux' with KoruX-specific images
      for the Calamares installer
    - Added DevilutionX (Diablo 1) packages ('devilutionx' and 'devilutionx-data'),
      which are not yet available in Debian
    - Added metadata file listing the sources and repositories for the included
      packages

- Added default live-build hooks for 'live' and 'normal' modes to config/hooks

- Added config/includes.chroot_after_packages/opt/game-scripts with installers
  for classic games: Diablo 1-2, Heroes 3, Quake 1-2-3 (make this distribution more fun)

- Added config/includes.chroot_after_packages/etc with minimal 'etc' configuration

- Added config/includes.chroot_after_packages/usr with fonts, desktop themes,
  and local bin scripts; set desktop theme to korux-theme and font to
  PxPlus Cordata PPC-400

- Added KoruX-specific hooks to config/hooks/normal

- Added user environment configuration files (skel)

- Added minimalistic configuration of Xfce and LightDM

- Added minimal hardened defaults for Firefox, OpenSSL, PAM, sshd, sudoers,
  GRUB, and sysctl (ASLR)
